            "review_text": "leungpolo\nHong Kong, China17 contributions\n0\nA Restaurant You Should Avoid\nMay 2023 • Couples\nThe worst dining experience I've ever had in Danang. I found out they gave me Shrimps, not the Big Tiger Shrimps that I ordered and that were charged to my bill. The Clams were acceptable. I did not know how to describe the taste of the fried rice. Even the renowned banh mi fell short of expectations. Fortunately, the lemonade and watermelon juice are tasty.\nAmong the countless restaurants in Danang, I must praise myself for locating such a place. Hahahaha ...\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten June 27, 2023",
